{
 "about": [
  "CC_SMALL_FP8_EXPERIMENTAL, the faster variant of the small model (build_network.py <arch> --experimental; its own",
  "weights, dlssnr-small-experimental.bin): every pipeline of pipelines.json, \"change\" adds defines to the pipeline of that",
  "name, \"new\" builds extra pipelines from a base pipeline of pipelines.json. NR_SACT=1: ReLU as the Swin MLP activation",
  "(every fswin_t pipeline but the small model's pre block, fswinimagepreds32nh); NR_FIXP: the window attention is one",
  "fixed 64x64 probability table a layer (no QK^T, no softmax); NR_VOMERGE: with it, the V and output projections are one",
  "matrix. fswin32nhd: the decoder's plain C=32 layer on its own pipeline (the encoder's keeps the full attention);",
  "fixed-attention.txt lists the NR_FIXP pipelines (the host writes their tables). Temporal variants: pipelines.json."
 ],
